# Plausible racer bugs; each names the one property that must fail.

mutation keep the first copy silently on different bytes
detects DivergenceAlarmed
only gap2 bad
- THEN alarms' = alarms \cup {<<s, k>>}                \* Divergent
+           THEN UNCHANGED alarms                                \* Divergent

mutation a later copy overwrites the held one (last wins, not first)
detects ReleasedIsWinner
only gap2 bad
- ELSE IF slot[i].st # "empty" /\ slot[i].seq = k
+   ELSE IF slot[i].st # "empty" /\ slot[i].seq = k /\ FALSE

mutation a released slot is never reused, so the stream stalls
detects AllReleased
only gap
- ELSE IF k < next
+   ELSE IF k < next \/ slot[i].st = "released"

mutation off-by-one window admits a key that shares a slot with an unreleased one
detects HeldNotLost
only w2 n5
- IF k >= next + W
+   IF k > next + W

mutation the late test runs before the held test, so a divergent copy after release is never compared
detects DivergenceAlarmed
only 3src gap bad
- ELSE IF slot[i].st # "empty" /\ slot[i].seq = k
+   ELSE IF slot[i].st = "held" /\ slot[i].seq = k

mutation the window never holds a key past a gap
detects reach:GapHeld
- IF k >= next + W
+   IF k > next

mutation alarm on every duplicate
detects NoFalseAlarm
only dup
- ELSE UNCHANGED alarms                                \* Duplicate
+           ELSE alarms' = alarms \cup {<<s, k>>}                \* Duplicate

mutation the driver offers again before draining pop(), so the complete source's copy is dropped as TooFar
detects AllReleased
only w1 n3 2src clean
-   /\ ~CanPop
-   /\ k < N
+   /\ k < N

mutation pop hands out the item without consuming it, so it is released again
detects InOrderOnce
only w1 n3 2src clean
-   /\ slot' = [slot EXCEPT ![i].st = "released"]
-   /\ out' = Append(out, <<next, slot[i].val>>)
-   /\ next' = next + 1
+   /\ out' = Append(out, <<next, slot[i].val>>)
+   /\ UNCHANGED <<slot, next>>

mutation an alarm records a key outside the stream
detects TypeOK
only gap2 bad
- THEN alarms' = alarms \cup {<<s, k>>}                \* Divergent
+           THEN alarms' = alarms \cup {<<s, k + N>>}            \* Divergent
